# ── Job Matcher — environment configuration ─────────────────────────────────
#
# Eve loads .env / .env.local from the agent folder when you run `eve dev`
# from agents/job-matcher/. This keeps each agent's secrets isolated.
#
# Copy this file to .env in this folder:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Models are model-agnostic and env-driven. There is NO built-in default
# model id — each role resolves MODEL_<ROLE>_* -> MODEL_* -> an explicit
# startup error. See openspec/adr/0001-shared-agent-runtime-kit.md §4.
#
# This agent bootstraps Python + Docling into its own sandbox on first
# build (resume extraction only) — local/on-prem only, same caveat as
# privacy-classifier. See agents/privacy-classifier/PREREQUISITES.md for the
# shared pattern this reuses.

# ── Orchestrator (fetches, decides fan-out, merges, never scores) ──────────
MODEL_ORCHESTRATOR=claude-sonnet-5
MODEL_ORCHESTRATOR_BASE_URL=
MODEL_ORCHESTRATOR_API_KEY=your-key

# ── Job analyst (typed skill/evidence extraction — direct call for a single
# job link, or the job-analyst subagent per link when there is more than
# one; both paths resolve this same role so runs are comparable) ──────────
MODEL_JOB_ANALYST=claude-sonnet-5
MODEL_JOB_ANALYST_BASE_URL=
MODEL_JOB_ANALYST_API_KEY=your-key

# ── Fan-out (Bolt 3 — bounded concurrency for multi-job runs) ──────────────
# JOB_FANOUT_CONCURRENCY=3

# ── Generic fallback (simplest single-model setup) ─────────────────────────
# MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# MODEL_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# MODEL_API_KEY=your-key

# ── Vercel AI Gateway (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# MODEL_ORCHESTRATOR=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5
# AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=...
# (leave BASE_URL unset for the gateway path)

# ── Context window override (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────
# MODEL_ORCHESTRATOR_CONTEXT_WINDOW_TOKENS=128000
# MODEL_CONTEXT_WINDOW_TOKENS=128000

# ── Observability (optional; off unless an endpoint is set) ────────────────
# Traces export via the shared OTel pipeline (shared/lib/instrumentation.ts).
# Local Phoenix: `docker compose up -d` from the repo root.
# PHOENIX_COLLECTOR_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:6006
# PHOENIX_CLIENT_HEADERS=api_key=your-key

# Second/alternative OTLP backend (e.g. OpenObserve). Setting BOTH endpoint
# vars fans every span out to both backends independently.
# OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=https://openobserve.example.com/api/default
# OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_HEADERS=Authorization=Basic <base64 user:password>

# TELEMETRY_RECORD_IO=true

# ── Object storage for run artifacts (optional; no-op unless bucket set) ───
# OBJECT_STORE_BUCKET=my-agent-runs
# OBJECT_STORE_REGION=us-east-1
# OBJECT_STORE_ACCESS_KEY_ID=...
# OBJECT_STORE_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=...
# OBJECT_STORE_ENDPOINT=https://minio.internal:9000
# OBJECT_STORE_FORCE_PATH_STYLE=true
# OBJECT_STORE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://cdn.example.com
